{"3129420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ASPIS", "steam_appid": 3129420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>USSR, late 1980s.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In an attempt to look beyond the edge of time, Soviet scientists accidentally tore the fabric of reality.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ASPIS</strong> is a mystical thriller about a system that tried to predict the future… and became a trap for those who looked inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/d6d87dff7e9bac809608c5c1e951c208.poster.avif?t=1785492457\" width=428 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/d6d87dff7e9bac809608c5c1e951c208.webm?t=1785492457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/d6d87dff7e9bac809608c5c1e951c208.mp4?t=1785492457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the center</strong> of the story is <strong>Andrey</strong>, a cybernetics scientist longing to bring back his lost family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hoping to see</strong> his loved ones again, even in virtual reality, he volunteers to test the <strong>ASPIS</strong> system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But instead</strong>, he is drawn into a dangerous experiment, gradually uncovering the secrets of the system — and his own tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/1283c257fb8d821e2ab79e8d448508b1.poster.avif?t=1785492457\" width=454 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/1283c257fb8d821e2ab79e8d448508b1.webm?t=1785492457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/1283c257fb8d821e2ab79e8d448508b1.mp4?t=1785492457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You will explore the <strong>Institute of Cybernetics</strong> and descend into surreal dimensions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Face the manifestations of distorted consciousness — and the one who decided to rewrite reality itself.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of the living, the world of souls, and the world of dreams — three sides of one catastrophe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soviet retrofuturism</strong> — the Institute of Cybernetics, the <strong><i><u>OGAS</u></i></strong> network (the Soviet analogue of the Internet), old computers, tape recorders, terminals, and a cold scientific approach to the inexplicable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story that intertwines the fates of volunteers, the secrets of the institute, and the philosophy of chaos — showing that trying to hold on to the past destroys reality itself.<strong></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay combines exploration, shooting, and puzzle-solving</strong> — uncover documents, analyze archives, and use <strong><i><u>OGAS</u></i></strong> to reveal the truth about the institute.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A philosophy of ambiguous choice — between life and the illusion created by the system itself.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>USSR, late 1980s.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In an attempt to look beyond the edge of time, Soviet scientists accidentally tore the fabric of reality.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ASPIS</strong> is a mystical thriller about a system that tried to predict the future… and became a trap for those who looked inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/d6d87dff7e9bac809608c5c1e951c208.poster.avif?t=1785492457\" width=428 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/d6d87dff7e9bac809608c5c1e951c208.webm?t=1785492457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/d6d87dff7e9bac809608c5c1e951c208.mp4?t=1785492457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the center</strong> of the story is <strong>Andrey</strong>, a cybernetics scientist longing to bring back his lost family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hoping to see</strong> his loved ones again, even in virtual reality, he volunteers to test the <strong>ASPIS</strong> system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But instead</strong>, he is drawn into a dangerous experiment, gradually uncovering the secrets of the system — and his own tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/1283c257fb8d821e2ab79e8d448508b1.poster.avif?t=1785492457\" width=454 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/1283c257fb8d821e2ab79e8d448508b1.webm?t=1785492457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/1283c257fb8d821e2ab79e8d448508b1.mp4?t=1785492457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You will explore the <strong>Institute of Cybernetics</strong> and descend into surreal dimensions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Face the manifestations of distorted consciousness — and the one who decided to rewrite reality itself.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of the living, the world of souls, and the world of dreams — three sides of one catastrophe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soviet retrofuturism</strong> — the Institute of Cybernetics, the <strong><i><u>OGAS</u></i></strong> network (the Soviet analogue of the Internet), old computers, tape recorders, terminals, and a cold scientific approach to the inexplicable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story that intertwines the fates of volunteers, the secrets of the institute, and the philosophy of chaos — showing that trying to hold on to the past destroys reality itself.<strong></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay combines exploration, shooting, and puzzle-solving</strong> — uncover documents, analyze archives, and use <strong><i><u>OGAS</u></i></strong> to reveal the truth about the institute.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A philosophy of ambiguous choice — between life and the illusion created by the system itself.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "ASPIS is an atmospheric mystical thriller set in an alternative USSR of the late 80s. You play as a scientist who has lost his family and is involved in a dangerous experiment to create a reality simulation. Explore the cybernetics institute, travel between worlds and encounter a distorted reality", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</stron